OL,8,Fdistressing
OL,10,FA murderer who stabbed his victim 22
OL,11,Ftimes before cooking and eating his
OL,12,Ffinger and setting his flat on fire has
OL,13,Fbeen jailed for 23 years.
OL,15,FGabriel Brown killed Joseph Ernest
OL,16,FJohnston, 58, at the victim's home in
OL,17,FAnnan, Dumfries and Galloway, on 19
OL,18,FNovember 2024.
